      <p>The User realizes and unconditionally accepts the technological specifics of AI: due to the probabilistic algorithms of neural networks, the Service may generate similar or identical Content for different Users (especially if niches, target audiences, or input data coincide). The Owner does not guarantee absolute uniqueness of the Content. The User voluntarily accepts the risk of possible coincidence of generation results and waives any claims against the Owner or third parties related to the lack of content uniqueness or violation of "copyright" to AI generation results.</p>
      <p>3.9.2. Conditional character (Conditionality) and revocation of rights: The rights specified in clause 3.9.1 are granted to the User only subject to strict compliance with the terms of the Offer and this Agreement. In case of termination of the Agreement due to the User's fault (including, but not limited to: "toxic behavior", violation of License terms, reverse engineering attempts), the license granted for all previously obtained Content is automatically annulled (Revocation). From the moment of annulment, the User is obliged to stop any use of the Content and ensure the deletion of all its copies.</p>
