      <p>3.9.6. Data Portability & GDPR: The User has the right to export their personal data and generation results (Content) in a commonly accepted machine-readable format (e.g., PDF or JSON) exclusively during the validity period of the active account. The Owner bears no obligation to provide tools for data export after termination of the Agreement or expiration of access to Methodology stages. Content export does not terminate the restrictions established in clause 3.9.3 (prohibition on training third-party AI).</p>
